WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:09.840
Hey, welcome back to 40 Days of Holiness. Grab your workbook.

2
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.540
If you don't have one, of course, you can go to

3
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.840
www.40daysofholiness.com and grab yours.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.680
Here's today's theme on day number six,

5
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:22.900
"God saves his people from slavery for

6
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:23.440
holiness."

7
00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:28.140
I want to call out today a little lie that exists in many people's

8
00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:32.080
heads, and here's what it is. "I have to be holy and get my act together

9
00:00:32.089 --> 00:00:34.200
so God will want me and love me and save me."

10
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.220
No, not true. That's a lie. Now, wait a minute.

11
00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:40.920
I thought we were just saying this whole thing was about holiness.

12
00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.940
This is God's main point. It's what he's trying to produce in us.

13
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.020
That's true.

14
00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:50.340
He is trying to create that in your life and your heart. So what happened to that?

15
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.339
Well, let me teach you something really, really valuable.

16
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.140
You have to understand this. Salvation

17
00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.220
is by grace

18
00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:04.840
for holiness. God saved his people from slavery

19
00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:07.140
before they were holy in his sight.

20
00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.580
He delivered them from slavery because of his kindness to them, not

21
00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:14.880
because they had their act together. They were mixed up.

22
00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:16.620
They were stubborn in a million ways.

23
00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:20.480
They were not holy, but he delivered them anyway, and

24
00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.380
we call that grace.

25
00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:28.330
Now, I want you to notice that God did not try to leave them in slavery and

26
00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:31.960
teach them holiness. Instead, he brought them out,

27
00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:35.860
and then he takes them to the mountain, the children of Israel.

28
00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.060
He brings them out of slavery in Egypt and takes them to Mount Sinai and teaches

29
00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.560
them holiness. He makes his covenant.

30
00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:43.280
That's where he says, "I am the Lord your God.

31
00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:47.560
Be holy because I am." The exodus from Egypt came before

32
00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:51.520
the covenant of holiness. Deliverance was all about

33
00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:54.300
grace, but it was for the purpose of holiness.

34
00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.260
Your salvation is not because you've been good or you've been holy.

35
00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.820
It was completely and totally of grace.

36
00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:03.820
No contribution of goodness on your part at all.

37
00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:08.000
God did it because of past promises he made to

38
00:02:08.039 --> 00:02:10.961
display his glory as a saving, faithful God.

39
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.740
He made promises to Abraham, and he's keeping those.

40
00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:16.840
He made promises to Jesus, and he's keeping those.

41
00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:20.700
Your salvation was by grace, but your salvation is

42
00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:24.760
for the purpose of holiness. So since I don't know

43
00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:28.340
everybody that's watching this and going through this 40-day journey with me, I

44
00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:30.100
have to make sure you understand.

45
00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:33.220
Holiness isn't so God will love you.

46
00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:36.660
It's not so that God will save you.

47
00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:41.400
The covenant of holiness God makes between him and his people, and that's

48
00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:41.800
you and me,

49
00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:46.980
is coming after he delivers us from bondage and slavery to

50
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.730
sin. So the first thing that I have to ask you is

51
00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:54.740
this. Have you been saved? Have you trusted

52
00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:58.540
in Jesus and been saved from the penalty of sin by

53
00:02:58.660 --> 00:02:59.460
faith in his blood?

54
00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:03.920
Now, if you've been thinking, "Well, I'm going to get holy and then God's going to

55
00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:07.090
be pleased and save me," then you've got it exactly

56
00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:10.370
backwards. You're saved by grace

57
00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:14.860
for holiness. God wants to save you not because of any

58
00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:17.680
holiness or goodness that you've gotten a hold of,

59
00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:22.620
but because of his kindness and his grace showered on us through

60
00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:26.080
Jesus Christ. Ephesians 2:8-9 says this,

61
00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:30.400
"For it is by grace you have been saved, through faith—and this is

62
00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:34.280
not of yourselves, it is the gift of

63
00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:38.120
God—not of works so that no one can boast."

64
00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:42.329
Now, if you're saved, you're not wrong to pursue holiness.

65
00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:46.000
In fact, it's the most natural thing in the world to chase

66
00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:49.970
after if God's really saved you. The next verse after the one I just

67
00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:53.900
read, Ephesians 2:10, says, "For we are God's handiwork,

68
00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:57.740
created in Christ Jesus to do good works, which God

69
00:03:57.780 --> 00:04:01.060
prepared in advance for us to do." You see the progression?

70
00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:05.420
You're saved by grace for good works, by grace

71
00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:08.340
for holiness. Now, don't miss this.

72
00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:12.800
Holiness is part of the gospel. It is the result

73
00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.480
of, it is the natural progression of the gospel.

74
00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.000
Some people treat salvation by faith like that's the gospel.

75
00:04:19.019 --> 00:04:21.740
It's the good news, and holiness is like it's the irrelevant news.

76
00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:26.620
Don't do that. Your salvation, the whole point of it is

77
00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:30.820
for holiness. It's not just some eternal fire insurance where down the road you can

78
00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:34.720
be with Jesus when you die. It's for the purpose of holiness now.

79
00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:39.400
God takes his people out of Egypt, then takes them to Sinai to make

80
00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:43.320
his covenant of holiness with them and to teach them about

81
00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:43.660
him.

82
00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:48.060
So it's the most natural thing in the world once you're saved to start

83
00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.500
pursuing holiness because that's literally

84
00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:54.740
what God saved you for. So

85
00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:59.180
if you're just realizing that you're not saved, no problem.

86
00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:02.860
Let's get that set straight right now, immediately.

87
00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:05.320
Trust in Jesus today. Repent of sin.

88
00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:08.640
Leave your life of slavery to sin and death.

89
00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:12.850
Do it right now because he's good and because he's kind, not

90
00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.820
because you're holy and you've got it all together.

91
00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:19.620
Jesus is your Moses. Let him lead you out of the land of slavery

92
00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:22.800
and bondage and lead you to his kingdom.

93
00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:26.600
He's here to do it now, not wait until you've got your act together.

94
00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.620
But if you are already saved and you know you are, you know you're right with

95
00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:32.920
God, then realize this.

96
00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:37.320
God didn't save you for heaven or some eternal fire insurance or

97
00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:40.820
because he felt sorry for you. He saved

98
00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:44.380
you for holiness. That's what's

99
00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:47.020
next. So let's keep moving forward.

100
00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:50.890
Let's keep pursuing holiness together because that's the whole point of

101
00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:52.780
why God saved you.

102
00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.680
I'll see you tomorrow. Make sure you do your workbook. Don't forget.

103
00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:57.270
Don't

104
00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:01.900
skip over it. Take some time to think through, fill in blanks,

105
00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:06.080
think through the meditation questions because God's got work he's doing in you

106
00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:09.110
through the Holy Spirit. And so let me just encourage you to keep on going.

107
00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:12.520
Don't stop. Keep pushing forward. I'll see you tomorrow.
